issue_context.body:
The ILLink analyzer is missing warnings for attribute dataflow when the attribute instances are on fields/properties/events.

```csharp
class C
{
	[KeepsPublicMethods (Type = typeof (ClassWithKeptPublicMethods))] // warns in ILLink, but not analyzer!
	public static bool field;
}

class ClassWithKeptPublicMethods
{
	[RequiresUnreferencedCode ("--ClassWithKeptPublicMethods--")]
	public static void KeptMethod () { }
}

class KeepsPublicMethodsAttribute : Attribute
{
	[DynamicallyAccessedMembers (DynamicallyAccessedMemberTypes.PublicMethods)]
	public Type Type { get; [Kept] set; }
}
```

Attributes placed on methods work as expected.
